  <string name="about_text">WaveDeck %1$s
Android music player

Local audio, YouTube and direct audio URLs. Background playback, lock-screen controls, wired and Bluetooth media buttons.

Single headset click: play/pause. Double: next. Triple: previous.

YouTube availability depends on the site and your connection. This build plays public videos; it does not import desktop Google sessions.</string>
